DFS or BFS through the graph; track visited. Return True if target is reached.

```python
def dfs_reachable(graph, src, target):
    if src == target:
        return True
    seen = {src}
    stack = [src]
    while stack:
        node = stack.pop()
        for nb in graph.get(node, []):
            if nb == target:
                return True
            if nb not in seen:
                seen.add(nb)
                stack.append(nb)
    return False
